[[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891354\">1016A10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the vacuum pipe from EGR solenoid (1a) and EGR valve\n(1b).</p><p>2. Undo the bolts.</p><p>3. Remove the EGR system vacuum pipe.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034233.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the vacuum pipe.</p><p>Connect both rubber sections of the vacuum\n pipe to the EGR valve and solenoid.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891354\">1016A10</a></p>"]]